  "Both of your answers are the autonomy correlation - the second line still says autonomy. Change it to workload.": "Beide antwoorden zijn de autonomiecorrelatie - de tweede regel zegt nog steeds autonomy. Verander dat in workload.",
  "Both of your differences run backwards. Each simple effect is the training-Yes cell minus the training-No cell within that level of mentoring.": "Beide verschillen lopen achterstevoren. Elk enkelvoudig effect is de cel training-Yes min de cel training-No binnen dat niveau van mentoring.",
